{"id":"gamefreak-lineblog-8215826","kind":"blog","title":"【日记】2016宝可梦中心签名会","display_title":null,"dek":null,"date":"2016-10-16","publication":"増田順一 公式ブログ · ポケモンセンタースカイツリータウン","issue":null,"interviewee":[],"people":[{"name":"增田顺一","slug":"masuda-junichi"}],"works":[],"era":null,"url":"https://docs.pokeamice.com/gamefreak-director/lineblog-8215826/","body_kind":"markdown","segment_count":null,"cover":null,"archive_type":"gamefreak_masuda_lineblog","summary":"在东京晴空塔城宝可梦中心，增田顺一与粉丝交流并完成全国11处、1100人的20周年签名会。","interviewer":null,"translator":null,"tags":["Game Freak","增田顺一","LINE BLOG","イベント"],"original_lang":null,"translation_status":"openai-machine-translated","source":{"title":"増田順一 公式ブログ · ポケモンセンタースカイツリータウン","url":"https://lineblog.me/masudajunichi/archives/8215826.html","archive_url":"https://web.archive.org/web/20161019164918id_/https://lineblog.me/masudajunichi/archives/8215826.html","type":"official_blog_wayback"},"body":{"kind":"markdown","markdown_zh":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">就从</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">和这些皮卡丘一起开始！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/8215826/001-5690662102.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/8215826/001-5690662102.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"959\" height=\"1278\"></a></figure>\n\n增田被夹在中间啦（笑）\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n签名会\n前来参加的大家\n真的非常感谢！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/8215826/002-37b611ad55.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/8215826/002-37b611ad55.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"930\" height=\"1259\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/8215826/003-971a83423b.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/8215826/003-971a83423b.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"930\" height=\"1259\"></a></figure>\n\n签名会的气氛，有传达给大家吗？\n（得到了许可）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n今天生日的两位\n\n<br>\n\n\n奄美大岛的松饼小哥\n\n<br>\n\n\n因为聊起延冈话题而热烈交谈的延冈出身女孩\n\n<br>\n\n\n没去过群马野生动物园的\n群马县女孩\n\n<br>\n\n\n还有留学生，以及从海外旅行中来找我的人\n\n<br>\n\n\n等等\n・\n・\n\n<br>\n\n\n和大家\n聊了好多好多\n我真的很开心！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/8215826/004-c8af5fd553.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/8215826/004-c8af5fd553.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1200\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n日本全国的宝可梦中心\n11处、为1100人签名的\n这次20周年签名会\n顺利结束啦！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n前来参加的大家\n真的非常感谢！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n最后……\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/8215826/005-84dceb1854.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/8215826/005-84dceb1854.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1200\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/8215826/006-509c13b7a7.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/8215826/006-509c13b7a7.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1200\"></a></figure>\n\n宝可梦中心晴空塔城\n我就在这里签的名哦！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n下回再见！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n（附赠）\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/8215826/007-afac029643.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/8215826/007-afac029643.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"749\" height=\"1105\"></a></figure>\n\n\n穿着这身回家中（笑）</div>","markdown_ja":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">スタートは</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">このピカチュウたちと共に！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/8215826/001-5690662102.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/8215826/001-5690662102.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"959\" height=\"1278\"></a></figure>\n\nマスダ挟まれチュウ（笑）\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nサイン会に\n来てくださった皆さん\n本当にありがとうございました！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/8215826/002-37b611ad55.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/8215826/002-37b611ad55.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"930\" height=\"1259\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/8215826/003-971a83423b.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/8215826/003-971a83423b.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"930\" height=\"1259\"></a></figure>\n\nサイン会の雰囲気伝わるかな？\n（許可もらいました）\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n今日誕生日だったお二人\n\n<br>\n\n\n奄美大島のパンケーキのお兄さん\n\n<br>\n\n\n延岡話で盛り上がった延岡出身の女の子\n\n<br>\n\n\n群馬サファリパークに行ったことない\n群馬県民の女の子\n\n<br>\n\n\n留学生や海外から旅行中に来てくれて\n\n<br>\n\n\nなどなど\n・\n・\n\n<br>\n\n\nみなさんと\nたくさん話す事が出来て\n嬉しかったです！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/8215826/004-c8af5fd553.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/8215826/004-c8af5fd553.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1200\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n日本全国ポケモンセンター\n11ヶ所1100人にサインした\n今回の20周年サイン会\n無事終了です！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n来てくださった皆さん\n本当にありがとうございました！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n最後に・・・\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/8215826/005-84dceb1854.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/8215826/005-84dceb1854.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1200\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/8215826/006-509c13b7a7.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/8215826/006-509c13b7a7.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1200\"></a></figure>\n\nポケモンセンタースカイツリータウン\nここにサインしたよ！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nチャオ！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n（オマケ）\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/8215826/007-afac029643.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/8215826/007-afac029643.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"749\" height=\"1105\"></a></figure>\n\n\nこの格好で帰宅チュウ（笑）</div>"}}